hwdata is the database of hardware identifiers: PCI and USB vendor and device names
(pci.ids, usb.ids) and monitor vendor ids (pnp.ids). libdisplay-info needs pnp.ids to
name monitors, and libudev-zero reads usb.ids. Pure data, no build step. Installs
under /usr/local/share/hwdata with a hwdata.pc in /usr/local/share/pkgconfig.
upstream: https://github.com/vcrhonek/hwdata
